cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Learning Signal Check, please cite it as below."
title: "Learning Signal Check"
abstract: >-
  A portable AI skill for checking whether assessments still reveal meaningful
  evidence of student learning in the age of AI, then suggesting a targeted
  redesign only when the learning signal is weakened. Its diagnostic procedure
  operationalizes Kane's validity argument, walking the assessment evidence chain
  (construct, scoring, generalization, extrapolation, implications) and repairing
  the earliest weakened inference.
type: software
